# Isshin, Two Heavens as One affects only abilities whose trigger is attacking itself, not one that triggers on something
# an attack also does, such as becoming tapped (the rulings, CR 603.2d). Magda, Brazen Outlaw attacks beside Isshin and
# becomes tapped: "Whenever a Dwarf you control becomes tapped, create a Treasure token" triggers once - one Treasure.
# Turn 1: Isshin (Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet). Turn 3: Magda (Mountain and the Ruby). Turn 5: both attack, for 2 + 3.

